# An edit and a reschedule made in a Today pane are undone from the outline pane next to it and redone back in the Today pane.
file <<END
INBOX: @inbox
	- Renew passport @due({today-3})
Work:
	- Write report @due({today-2})
END
keys <C-w> s gt <Enter>
type  soon
keys <Esc> W
see ▌ - Write report  Work
keys g1 z
see - Renew passport soon  INBOX
keys z
see - Renew passport  INBOX
keys g2 Z Z
quit
saved <<END
INBOX: @inbox
	- Renew passport soon @due({today+1})
Work:
	- Write report @due({today-2})
END
